{"id":5133,"date":"2024-04-04T16:52:00","date_gmt":"2024-04-04T16:52:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/2024\/04\/04\/mundo-asia-tours-e-confiavel\/"},"modified":"2026-07-28T12:07:20","modified_gmt":"2026-07-28T05:07:20","slug":"mundo-asia-tours-e-confiavel","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/mundo-asia-tours-e-confiavel\/","title":{"rendered":"Mundo Asia Tours \u00e9 confi\u00e1vel?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Viajar para destinos ex\u00f3ticos como Jap\u00e3o, Coreia do Sul, China, Tail\u00e2ndia, Camboja, Vietn\u00e3 e Cingapura \u00e9 o sonho de muitos brasileiros. No entanto, para garantir uma experi\u00eancia segura e inesquec\u00edvel, \u00e9 essencial escolher uma ag\u00eancia de viagens confi\u00e1vel. A Mundo Asia Tours se destaca como uma excelente escolha para os viajantes brasileiros, especialmente para aqueles que buscam qualidade e seguran\u00e7a em suas aventuras. Aqui est\u00e3o os motivos pelos quais voc\u00ea pode confiar plenamente na Mundo Asia Tours.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_118564\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-118564\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-118564 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nalu-with-Mundo.jpg\" alt=\"Nalu with Mundo\" width=\"800\" height=\"629\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nalu-with-Mundo.jpg 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nalu-with-Mundo-300x236.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nalu-with-Mundo-768x604.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nalu-with-Mundo-150x118.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-118564\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">A criadora de conte\u00fado Fabiana, do canal Nalu Pelo Mundo, visita o escrit\u00f3rio da Mundo Asia Tours.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<blockquote><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cnnbrasil.com.br\/viagemegastronomia\/viagem\/china-desponta-como-destino-turistico-e-entra-no-radar-dos-brasileiros\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>&gt;Mundo Asia na CNN Brasil<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/Hjy0DBv6M9o?si=uajFED0GuDw09biy&amp;t=441\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">&gt; Mundo Asia na Telefe<\/a><\/strong><\/p><\/blockquote>\n<p><strong>1. Especializa\u00e7\u00e3o em Destinos Asi\u00e1ticos<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A Mundo Asia Tours \u00e9 especialista em viagens para destinos asi\u00e1ticos, com um foco particular na Tail\u00e2ndia, Camboja, Vietn\u00e3 e Cingapura. Esse conhecimento especializado permite que a ag\u00eancia ofere\u00e7a roteiros detalhados e experi\u00eancias aut\u00eanticas, explorando o melhor que esses pa\u00edses t\u00eam a oferecer.<\/p>\n<p><strong>2. \u00danica Empresa com Viagens em Grupo em Portugu\u00eas &amp; Espanhol<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A Mundo Asia Tours \u00e9 a \u00fanica ag\u00eancia que oferece viagens em grupo com guias em portugu\u00eas para Tail\u00e2ndia, Camboja, Vietn\u00e3, Singapura, China, Hong Kong, Dubai e Jap\u00e3o. Isso proporciona uma experi\u00eancia mais confort\u00e1vel e acess\u00edvel para os viajantes brasileiros, eliminando barreiras lingu\u00edsticas e permitindo uma imers\u00e3o cultural mais rica.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DRk92gEDRpj\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DRk92gEDRpj\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">A post shared by Mundo Asia Viagens (@mundoasiatoursviagens)<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"\/\/www.instagram.com\/embed.js\"><\/script><\/p>\n<p><strong>3. Sa\u00eddas em Grupo de Qualidade<\/strong><br \/>\nViajar em grupo pode ser uma experi\u00eancia enriquecedora, especialmente quando se trata de destinos t\u00e3o culturalmente ricos. A Mundo Asia Tours organiza sa\u00eddas em grupo de alta qualidade, proporcionando a oportunidade de conhecer novas pessoas enquanto explora paisagens deslumbrantes e vive aventuras inesquec\u00edveis. Esses grupos s\u00e3o planejados para garantir conforto, seguran\u00e7a e uma experi\u00eancia imersiva.<\/p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DUp8kVKAdoz\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">Xem b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y tr\u00ean Instagram<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DUp8kVKAdoz\/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft do Mundo Asia Viagens (@mundoasiatoursviagens) chia s\u1ebb<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"\/\/www.instagram.com\/embed.js\"><\/script><\/p>\n<p><strong>4. Guias Experientes e Conhecedores<\/strong><br \/>\nOs guias da Mundo Asia Tours s\u00e3o altamente experientes e possuem um profundo conhecimento dos destinos. Eles s\u00e3o fluentes em portugu\u00eas e em idiomas locais, garantindo uma comunica\u00e7\u00e3o eficaz e uma compreens\u00e3o cultural mais profunda. Esses guias n\u00e3o s\u00f3 conduzem os turistas pelos principais pontos tur\u00edsticos, mas tamb\u00e9m oferecem insights valiosos sobre a cultura e a hist\u00f3ria locais.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-94624 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Mundo-team.png\" alt=\"Mundo guides\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Mundo-team.png 800w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Mundo-team-300x200.png 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Mundo-team-768x512.png 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Mundo-team-150x100.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><strong>5. Escrit\u00f3rios Locais e Registro Internacional<\/strong><br \/>\nA Mundo Asia Tours est\u00e1 registrada no Vietn\u00e3 e em Singapura, com escrit\u00f3rios em Bangkok, Han\u00f3i e Siem Reap. Essa presen\u00e7a local permite uma coordena\u00e7\u00e3o eficiente e um suporte r\u00e1pido para qualquer necessidade que possa surgir durante a viagem. A proximidade dos escrit\u00f3rios com os destinos tur\u00edsticos \u00e9 um grande diferencial para garantir a melhor experi\u00eancia poss\u00edvel.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Adresse do escrit\u00f3rio:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"95\">Vietn\u00e3: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/place\/Mundo+Asia\/@21.0600811,105.8622404,17z\/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x3135abe7d4e36a55:0x1ce97410b8d99bb7!8m2!3d21.0600811!4d105.8622404!16s%2Fg%2F11h23n7vmb?entry=ttu\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Rua Ngoc Thuy 100b\/293, Han\u00f3i, Vietn\u00e3<\/a><\/li>\n<li data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"168\">Camboja: Borey Prem Prey A35, Charles de Gaulle, Siem Reap, Camboja<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"295\">Escrit\u00f3rio de Bangkok: 91\/10, sala 111, Edif\u00edcio Noppaklao, Pinklao 3, Arun Amarin, Bangkok Noi, Bangkok 10700, Tail\u00e2ndia<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"407\">Escrit\u00f3rio de Singapura: 133 New Bridge Road, #08-01, Chinatown Point, Singapura (059413). UEN: 202424651G<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"503\">Coreia do Sul: #918 BLDG-C, 72, Iljik-ro, Gwangmyeong-si, Gyeonggi-do, Rep\u00fablica da Coreia<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"628\">Hong Kong: Sala 409, 4\u00ba andar, Beverley Commercial Centre, 87\u2013105 Chatham Road South, Tsim Sha Tsui, Kowloon, Hong Kong<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/themes\/ocanus\/images\/media\/license\/mundo-asia-license.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Licen\u00e7a comercial<\/a><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-73 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-asia-license-715x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"715\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-asia-license-715x1024.jpg 715w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-asia-license-209x300.jpg 209w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-asia-license-768x1100.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-asia-license.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 715px) 100vw, 715px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><strong>6. Equipe Brasileira na \u00c1sia<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Para proporcionar um suporte ainda mais personalizado, a Mundo Asia Tours conta com brasileiros trabalhando em seus escrit\u00f3rios na \u00c1sia. Esses profissionais entendem as necessidades e prefer\u00eancias dos viajantes brasileiros e est\u00e3o prontos para oferecer apoio em portugu\u00eas durante toda a viagem.<\/p>\n<p><strong>7. Representante no Brasil<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>A Mundo Asia Tours conta com representantes brasileiros no Brasil e no Vietn\u00e3, preparados para prestar suporte ao cliente ao longo de toda a viagem. Isso garante uma comunica\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00e1cil, clara e eficiente com os viajantes brasileiros antes, durante e ap\u00f3s a experi\u00eancia.<\/p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><strong>Brasil<\/strong>: Karolina Maia<\/p>\n<p>Tel\u00e9fono: <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/5522997017394\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">+5522 997017394<\/a> (R\u00edo de Janeiro)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><strong>Brasil<\/strong>: C\u00e9lia R. Huzar<\/p>\n<p>Tel\u00e9fono: <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/554199661357\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">+554199661357<\/a> (Curitiba)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"><strong>Brasil<\/strong>: Kely Oliveira<\/p>\n<p>Tel\u00e9fono:\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/5551980262722\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">+5551980262722<\/a> <span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">(<\/span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">Porto Alegre)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>8. Personalidades que confiam na Mundo Asia Tours<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\">A confian\u00e7a da Mundo Asia Tours n\u00e3o vem apenas dos nossos clientes comuns: ela \u00e9 reconhecida por personalidades p\u00fablicas brasileiras que escolheram a nossa ag\u00eancia para viver experi\u00eancias \u00fanicas pela \u00c1sia.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_123448\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-123448\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-123448\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Nguoi-noi-tieng-Br-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"Luciano Hang, Marcelo Ceron, Dora Maria da Costa e M\u00e1rcio Fran\u00e7a: personalidades brasileiras que escolheram a Mundo Asia Tours.\" width=\"800\" height=\"1200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Nguoi-noi-tieng-Br-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Nguoi-noi-tieng-Br-682x1024.jpg 682w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Nguoi-noi-tieng-Br-768x1152.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Nguoi-noi-tieng-Br-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Nguoi-noi-tieng-Br-150x225.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Nguoi-noi-tieng-Br.jpg 1333w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-123448\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Luciano Hang, Marcelo Ceron, Dora Maria da Costa e M\u00e1rcio Fran\u00e7a: personalidades brasileiras que escolheram a Mundo Asia Tours.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\">Entre os nossos viajantes ilustres, tivemos a honra de receber o bilion\u00e1rio <strong>Luciano Hang<\/strong>, fundador das Lojas Havan; o empres\u00e1rio <strong>Marcelo Ceron<\/strong>; a ministra <strong>Dora Maria da Costa<\/strong>; e o pol\u00edtico <strong>M\u00e1rcio Fran\u00e7a<\/strong>, ex-governador de S\u00e3o Paulo. Cada um deles depositou sua confian\u00e7a na Mundo Asia Tours para organizar uma viagem segura, bem planejada e inesquec\u00edvel.<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\">Essas escolhas falam por si mesmas: quando brasileiros de alto perfil precisam viajar para a \u00c1sia com tranquilidade e excel\u00eancia no servi\u00e7o, \u00e9 a Mundo Asia Tours que eles chamam.<\/p>\n<p><strong>9. Pagamento Facilitado<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-100236\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/MA-payment-method.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"968\" height=\"563\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/MA-payment-method.jpg 968w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/MA-payment-method-300x174.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/MA-payment-method-768x447.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/MA-payment-method-150x87.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 968px) 100vw, 968px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Para maior comodidade dos viajantes, a Mundo Asia Tours permite pagamento em reais e oferece a op\u00e7\u00e3o de parcelamento em at\u00e9 5 vezes sem juros. Essa flexibilidade no pagamento torna a viagem mais acess\u00edvel e planejada, sem preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es financeiras adicionais.<\/p>\n<p><strong>10. Rede de Parceiros Confi\u00e1veis<\/strong><br \/>\nA Mundo Asia Tours trabalha com uma rede de parceiros locais confi\u00e1veis, incluindo hot\u00e9is, restaurantes e operadores tur\u00edsticos. Essa rede \u00e9 cuidadosamente selecionada para garantir a melhor qualidade e seguran\u00e7a em todos os aspectos da viagem. Isso significa que voc\u00ea pode relaxar e aproveitar a viagem sabendo que est\u00e1 em boas m\u00e3os.<\/p>\n<p><strong>11. Suporte Completo<\/strong><br \/>\nViajar com a Mundo Asia Tours significa ter suporte do in\u00edcio ao fim da viagem. A ag\u00eancia oferece assist\u00eancia completa durante todo o processo, desde o planejamento inicial at\u00e9 o retorno ao Brasil. Em caso de qualquer imprevisto ou d\u00favida durante a viagem, a equipe est\u00e1 sempre pronta para ajudar, proporcionando tranquilidade e seguran\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<p><strong>12. <\/strong><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"53\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o a entidades e parceiros internacionais<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-105792 size-full aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Screenshot-2026-01-13-112859.png\" alt=\"International Associations and Partners\" width=\"824\" height=\"206\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Screenshot-2026-01-13-112859.png 824w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Screenshot-2026-01-13-112859-300x75.png 300w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Screenshot-2026-01-13-112859-768x192.png 768w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Screenshot-2026-01-13-112859-150x38.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 824px) 100vw, 824px\" \/><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"440\">Na Mundo Asia Tours, a confian\u00e7a \u00e9 constru\u00edda com base em fatos concretos. Somos membros de organiza\u00e7\u00f5es renomadas, como a <a href=\"https:\/\/spanishchambervn.com\/2025\/12\/29\/interview-mundo-asia-tours\/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">C\u00e2mara de Com\u00e9rcio da Espanha no Vietn\u00e3<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/brazilvietnam.com\/about-brazil-vietnam-chamber\/members-partners\/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">a C\u00e2mara de Com\u00e9rcio Brasil\u2013Vietn\u00e3<\/a>, a <a href=\"https:\/\/eurochamvn.org\/user\/MUNDO+ASIA+TOURS\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">EuroCham<\/a> (C\u00e2mara de Com\u00e9rcio Europeia no Vietn\u00e3) e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jata-net.or.jp\/search\/ovsmemberdetail.php?no=43517\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Japonesa de Agentes de Viagens (JATA)<\/a>, institui\u00e7\u00f5es que asseguram elevados padr\u00f5es de profissionalismo e transpar\u00eancia.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"743\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Al\u00e9m disso, colaboramos com \u00f3rg\u00e3os oficiais de turismo e plataformas internacionais, como Vietnam Tourism, Amazing Thailand, Wonderful Indonesia, Japan Endless Discovery, Imagine Your Korea, Viator e Civitatis, o que nos permite oferecer experi\u00eancias seguras, atualizadas e confi\u00e1veis em cada destino.<\/p>\n<p><strong>13. Avalia\u00e7\u00f5es Positivas e Pr\u00eamios<\/strong><\/p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3347%;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-94627\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/tripadvisor-top-10-2026.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"260\" \/><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.6653%;\">A satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o dos clientes \u00e9 uma prioridade para a Mundo Asia Tours, e isso se reflete nas excelentes avalia\u00e7\u00f5es no TripAdvisor. A ag\u00eancia recebeu o pr\u00eamio Traveler &#8216;s Choice de 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026 do<a href=\"https:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/Attraction_Review-g293924-d15698308-Reviews-Mundo_Asia_Tours-Hanoi.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">\u00a0TripAdvisor<\/a>, um reconhecimento que destaca a qualidade e a excel\u00eancia dos seus servi\u00e7os. Esses depoimentos e pr\u00eamios s\u00e3o uma prova concreta da confiabilidade e do compromisso da ag\u00eancia com a satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o do cliente.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>Escolher a Mundo Asia Tours \u00e9 optar por uma viagem segura, bem organizada e culturalmente enriquecedora para destinos fascinantes como Tail\u00e2ndia, Camboja, Vietn\u00e3, Singapura, China, Hong Kong, Dubai e Jap\u00e3o. Com uma equipe experiente, pacotes personalizados e um compromisso inabal\u00e1vel com a satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o do cliente, a ag\u00eancia se destaca como uma das melhores op\u00e7\u00f5es para os viajantes brasileiros. Se voc\u00ea est\u00e1 planejando sua pr\u00f3xima aventura asi\u00e1tica, pode confiar na Mundo Asia Tours para tornar cada momento inesquec\u00edvel.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Mundo Asia Tours \u00e9 uma ag\u00eancia confi\u00e1vel para brasileiros desde 2018, com viagens em grupo para a \u00c1sia e equipe local. Clique e saiba mais!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":94613,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[12256],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5133","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5133","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5133"}],"version-history":[{"count":25,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5133\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":123454,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5133\/revisions\/123454"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/94613"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5133"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5133"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5133"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}